package_manager
rask-fetch: dependency resolver and package fetcher

Usage: package_manager [options] <command>

Arguments:
  <command>                    resolve, fetch (download to cache), lock (write rask.lock) or check (lock in sync?)

Options:
      --manifest <value>       Path to build.rk (default: build.rk)
      --registry <value>       Registry type, local or http (default: local)
      --registry-path <value>  Local registry directory
      --registry-url <value>   HTTP registry base URL
      --cache <value>          Cache directory (default: /tmp/rask-cache)
      --lock <value>           Lock file path (default: rask.lock)
  -h, --help                   Show this help
